Description:
    Installs solid_queue as the Active Job's queue adapter

Example:
    bin/rails generate solid_queue:install
    bin/rails generate solid_queue:install --backend=mongodb

    This will perform the following:
        Adds the solid_queue database schema for the Active Record backend
        Adds default configurations
        Replaces Active Job's adapter in environment configuration
        Installs bin/jobs binstub to start the supervisor
